WEBVTT

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.580
Let's cut the power and plunge 
the city into darkness!

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:51.090
It will make our human
kidnapping plan much easier!

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.940
Eat this, human scum!

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:23.950
Who's there?!

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:45.200
Fujimoto

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:52.650
Get him!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:34.060
<b>Magical Girl (?)
Makes Idol Debut!</b>

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:40.190
Fujimoto

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:39.250
Magical girls...

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.420
Magical girls.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.660
Magical girls!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:54.960
<b>Magical Girl - Versus Cyborg</b>

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.270
Good morning!

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.960
G-Good morning!

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.630
The magical girls are here!

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:12.350
Magical Girls

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.510
Here's your dressing room.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.360
Huh? Aren't the magical girls here yet?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.960
Oh right, right!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.350
Uh, we'll go get them!

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:28.780
I love Mikage Mohiro-chan!

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:33.480
I love Saki!

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.480
Magical... girls?

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.510
Men?

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:58.790
They're men, right?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:04:59.980
They are men...

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:05.980
<i>We've kinda stumbled into
 a debut as magical girl idols.</i>

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:09.350
<i>Now we're here for our 
first-ever TV appearance!</i>

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.150
<i>To stand on the stage I've always 
dreamed of... my heart is pounding!</i>

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.120
<i>I feel like everyone's staring at me...</i>

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:19.910
They're men, right?

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:20.770
They're men, right?

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.140
Male cosplayers?

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:23.600
Let it roll off your back.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:30.270
Are those the one's 
everyone's talking about?

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:32.630
Cute, aren't they?

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:35.650
Prisma-san, it's time for rehearsal!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.860
Okay! We're on our way!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.890
<i>And...</i>

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:47.320
[CG] Rumored Male Cosplayer (INSANE!)

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.470
<i>I love...</i>

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:51.230
Well, we'd better get going—

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.740
<i>I-I'm gonna get pounded!</i>

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.540
<i>Is this that "Boys Love" thing 
I've heard so much about?</i>

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.530
<i>Wait, what would this be called?</i>

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:01.360
As long as you're Saki,

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:04.330
I don't care if you're a man, 
a dog, or even an amoeba.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:06.800
<i>I'm totally not a dog or an amoeba!</i>

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:11.710
<i>My best friend Sakuyo declared 
her love for me to the world...</i>

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.920
<i>What's going to become of this?</i>

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.500
Their muscles are so thick...

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.510
<i>I feel everyone staring at me...</i>

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:27.310
<i>It's true that I wanted to be an idol...</i>

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.740
<i>I wanted to be an idol, but not like this!</i>

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.930
<i>No... just focus on the bright side.</i>

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.980
<i>He mentioned he was filming today...</i>

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.050
<i>Let me meet Mohiro-chan!</i>

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.900
<i>Let me meet Mohiro-chan!</i>

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.610
<i>Let me meet Mohiro-chan!</i>

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:47.640
<i>Think of the devil, and he appears!</i>

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.050
<i>What a good omen.</i>

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.630
<i>Who the hell is that?</i>

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:05.230
<i>No, seriously... who the hell is that?</i>

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.990
This feeling... Ore-san?!

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:16.330
<i>I was so wrapped up in
 the fight, I totally forgot!</i>

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.460
A-Are you hurt?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.660
What's with this positive response?

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:26.970
No, no, no... I just did 
what anyone would do.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.670
What's your name?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:33.420
My name? My name, my name...

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.760
I'm... I...

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.680
<i>If I tell him my name, he'll 
know, he'll know, he'll know!</i>

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:42.800
I'm... me. (Ore)

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.490
H-Hello.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.360
Thanks again for saving me.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.220
Um, who's that person behind you?

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.530
He's the AD guy.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.370
Oh, I see.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.620
It's good to see you.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.370
Would you like some candy, Ore-san?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.500
Yes, I would!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:09.730
<i>Oh, but... getting to have a 
conversation with Mohiro-chan...</i>

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:11.540
<i>I'm no longer afraid of anything.</i>

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.440
<i>What's this guy's problem?!</i>

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:19.390
Come on. You'll be late to the filming.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:22.610
<i>You masked weirdo!</i>

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:25.340
Oh, ah, it's okay!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.950
<i>Could that be Hyoe? No, 
he's way too short...</i>

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:31.290
Meet me in Studio B...

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.200
Uno Saki!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.570
What?

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.830
Did he just...

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.640
Hurry, you two! It's time for rehearsal!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:41.970
Okay!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.240
<i>Because I love you!</i>

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.820
Okay, thank you very much!

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.960
Please stand by until 
we're ready for filming!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:55.470
Thank you very much!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:58.820
Yes? Oh, thank you, thank you so much.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:09:01.760
Magical Girls

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:02.350
Yes, yes. Wait just a minute. Yes.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:04.100
<b>Studio B</b>

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.470
You're here? How brave.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.100
That expression...

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:17.620
You must be wondering how 
I knew your secret identity.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:23.370
What are you doing here? Is 
it Mohiro-chan you're after?

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:27.350
That strange outfit... are you a demon?

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:29.130
No, I am...

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.140
I am... a cyborg!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:41.380
My super mask system makes everything clear.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:42.890
<b>Incidentally</b>

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:44.520
Incidentally, my enhancements 
also let me pedal super-fast,

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.270
<b>Got Milk?</b>

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.700
change clothes at super-speed,

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.690
and perform superhuman feats.

00:09:51.390 --> 00:10:00.400
It was a truly tragic past that brought 
me to this state, yada yada yada...

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.710
Fujimoto

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.400
<i>This guy's nuts.</i>

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:05.770
You! You're thinking "this guy's nuts" 
or something, aren't you?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.860
You're one to talk! You're a man in drag!

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:10.410
I can tell! My eagle eyes see all!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.130
That's hitting me where it hurts...

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:19.390
Fujimoto

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:18.770
Still, it's a little hard 
to swallow all this...

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:21.690
And you have "Fujimoto" 
written on your chest...

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:24.930
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:23.870
You're a clever one.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:24.970
This, you see, is...

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.090
My real name!

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.040
So what?

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.650
What do you want from me? I'm freakin' poor!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:34.010
I'd love to have a super-cool 
super-suit or something!

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.820
And anyway, that's not what 
I came here to talk about!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.410
S-Sorry...

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.910
<b>Pictured: Magical girls 
succumbing to pressure</b>

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.020
Listen up!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.180
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:45.000
I was keeping the peace in this 
city long before you showed up!

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.120
That means I'm your senpai! 
Show me some respect!

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:52.530
Naturally, I also know that 
demons have been appearing

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:55.510
around Mikage Mohiro more 
frequently of late.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:11:00.120
I put on this ingenious disguise so 
that I could keep watch over him.

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:01.880
Ingenious?

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.240
To defeat evil is the duty of the good.

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:08.900
To help those in need is 
a part of my mission.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:12.390
Does that mean... you're on our side?

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:14.020
Don't get cocky!

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:15.480
You hear me?!

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.130
Heroes are supposed to be 
lonely and hard-boiled!

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.950
You freakin' weak ass 
magical girls are ruining that!

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.570
Listen up!

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:25.190
I hate you people!

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:27.610
I didn't come here to make 
peace or offer help!

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:29.200
This is a declaration of war!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.200
You got that?!

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.160
Hey...

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.960
That voice... can it be?

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.050
I doubt it's something they're filming.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.640
Hey, Saki... I mean, Magical Girl Ore-chan!

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:40.920
Manager!

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:43.100
It's an emergency! Come to the studio!

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.970
Huh? Who's this?

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:47.750
Um, this is the cyborg...

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.560
Fujimoto Ichigo.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:49.290
Oh, 'kay.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.650
Well anyway, hurry up!

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.720
Demons showed up during 
the filming on stage N!

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:56.020
<i>This guy really doesn't give a crap about 
anything besides magical girls...</i>

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.200
I knew it... they're after Mikage Mohiro!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:04.260
Perfect timing! You can stand back 
here and watch a true hero at work!

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.360
Ore-chan, you kids get there, too!

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:13.360
You can't let someone else steal your spotlight
after I landed you your first TV appearance!

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:14.890
<i>That's</i> what you're worried about?!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.240
That's the most important part!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.640
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.480
<b>Live Recording in Progress</b>

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:40.670
Fujimoto

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.480
Is everyone o—

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:48.490
The studio suddenly looks like an episode of a hero show!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.050
W-Who are these people?

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:53.740
Well... th-they're cute, aren't they?

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:56.190
This way.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.060
I'll save—

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:09.300
Stay out of this! I'll 
defeat them all myself!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:13.590
Let's start the final showtime!

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.600
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:17.330
It's transformation time!

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.080
The strongest...

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.860
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:26.320
Masked...

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:31.280
Kick!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.130
It's just a standard kick to the nuts!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.740
Why did you jump?

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:36.310
Fool, dummy, loser!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.250
C'mon, get in there already!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.020
Sheesh, ya just can't do a damn
thing without me, can ya?

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:45.300
When did you get here?

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.640
Fine.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:49.670
Okay, here we go!

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:50.350
Yeah.

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:00.510
Are you okay?

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:02.370
Y-Yes!

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:24.890
Felt like an easy win this time, huh?

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:26.250
Yeah, they were all grunts.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.170
You guys sure have grown!

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:31.810
You were like master whack-a-molers!

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:34.200
Oh, shucks...

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.280
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:40.810
<i>Every time I fight, I feel like 
something precious in me is dying.</i>

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.350
All right! Well, as a reward for today,

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:46.170
maybe I'll pass you some 
important information.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:48.610
Reward?

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.560
The truth is, this part on your staff...

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:54.670
That's blood from the demons 
you've defeated in the past.

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:58.460
It's a blood-suckin' stick.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.350
I could have done without knowing that.

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:02.600
It's really drained a lot, huh?

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.570
Well, keep up the good work!

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:05.670
Hey!

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.840
Don't ignore me!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.090
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:09.550
He's all beat up...

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:10.100
Are you o—

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.270
Hey, stay back!

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.550
If you don't, I'll k-kick you in the crotch!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.500
He's trembling like a newborn fawn...

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:20.180
Shut up! Don't you mock me!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.210
Fujimoto

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:41.910
That hurt!

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:43.930
Wh-Why?

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.510
You... Why did you save me?

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:51.420
I'm your enemy! Are you 
feeling sorry for me?!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:51.430
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.820
W-Why, you ask?

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:02.660
Because helping people in need 
is what the good guys do, right?

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:10.920
Damn you... How dare you... 
How dare you steal my line?!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.500
Ow ow ow!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:16.830
I thought she was just putting up 
with it to help Mohiro before,

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.470
but maybe she's becoming a bit 
more of a real magical girl.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:24.450
Um, do you see what's happened to my hand?

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.640
Could you give me a bit of a break, perhaps?

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:33.280
I might have been hoping for 
a little praise, you know...

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:35.920
Nope, guess she wasn't 
actually thinking anything.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:37.770
I think it's both.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.910
Saki's always been that kind of girl.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:46.320
But don't you go fallin' for her, loser!

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:49.870
A-As if, dammit! And don't call me a loser!

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:56.120
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.740
It seems I lost this time...

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:55.540
But don't expect any thanks.

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:00.880
Hey...

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.980
You, stupid-looking magical 
girl with the cowlick.

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:05.360
Stupid-looking?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.370
You look just like your 
predecessor did at that age!

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.040
Goodbye!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:17.950
<i>Predecessor? Has he been protecting 
this town for that long?</i>

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:20.360
<i>Which means...</i>

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:23.310
<i>How old must he be?</i>

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:26.480
Saki! Have you eaten?

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:30.180
<i>Maybe he's a super old 
man under that outfit?</i>

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:32.900
<i>Maybe I should be more respectful 
the next time we meet...</i>

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:39.740
<i>There are cameras filming 
freaking everywhere!</i>

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:42.170
That's right. We're in a studio...

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:45.700
Oops, I guess I maybe asked 
them to roll the cameras!

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.200
Tee-hee-blep!

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:48.250
<i>This guy doesn't have an off switch!</i>

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.430
What, are we on TV?

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:52.630
Oh, gosh!

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.020
Wh-Who's this sinewy fellow?

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:00.530
That's our fairy.

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:01.840
I'm Kokoro-chan.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.650
H-He's certainly cute.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:05.020
You know it!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.130
Don't strain yourself, Manager.

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.900
Where's Mohiro-chan?

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:16.040
He's safe?

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:33.250
You saved me not once, but twice. 
Thank you so much! I mean it.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.250
Oh, well... I... that is...

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.620
Look at this, everyone!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:39.140
<i>The</i> Mohiro is expressing his 
thanks to that magical girl!

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:41.140
Mohiro seems to care so much...

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.000
And the way they fought before...

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.390
Can it really be true?

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.960
Are you really a real magical girl?!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.470
It's not just a gimmick?

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:55.340
When did this start?

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:56.670
It's not just a setup?

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.910
U-U-Um...

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:02.440
Mohiro-san, you seem to 
have known him already...

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:05.220
What? You say he saved you once before?

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:06.660
They're the real thing!

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.400
Everyone, this is the face of 
the super-idol of tomorrow!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:13.640
Wait... I... ah...

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.900
Magical girl... Magical girl...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:34.440
That's right! I am your magical girl!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:39.850
Magical girl! Magical girl! Magical girl!

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:47.080
Magical girl! Magical girl! 
Magical girl! Magical girl!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.580
Well, I guess they're pretty cool after all.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.870
Wait, do you...

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.210
No, no way!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.880
<b>Live Recording in Progress</b>

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:04.300
I've gone and done it now.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:41.230
A hero's work begins in the morning.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:59.040
<b>Orefessional
Work Play</b>

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:59.040
The surprising truth behind 
early morning workers

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:53.700
The first battle comes in the mornings.

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.450
There is no justice in those 
who can't wake up early.

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:59.050
This is just a fact.

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.530
<b>Your Friendly Neighborhood Superhero
Fujimoto Ichigo</b>

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:15.180
<b>Orefessional
Work Play</b>

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:15.180
The surprising truth behind 
early morning workers

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:04.710
<i>Fujimoto Ichigo's mornings begin early.</i>

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:09.270
<i>For a protector of the world,
 there is no such thing as "rest".</i>

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.680
<i>This is what it means to be a professional.</i>

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.520
Look out!

00:22:20.510 --> 00:22:22.780
What the hell are you doing?!

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:27.030
What do you think? You were 
stealing that old woman's purse!

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:29.160
Who the hell are you?

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:31.050
I'm a professional justice-doer.

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:35.290
You're obviously in the middle of 
delivering milk and newspapers!

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.660
But now that you've seen 
me, I have no choice...

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:45.930
Damn you... this ain't over!

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:49.420
Are you all right, ma'am?

00:22:49.420 --> 00:22:52.520
W-Well... I'm more worried about you...

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:54.940
What's that coming from your stomach?

00:22:55.320 --> 00:22:56.770
Oh dear, oh dear.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.940
<b>Fujimoto</b>

00:22:56.770 --> 00:22:58.770
It looks like one of my parts came loose.

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:01.180
I'll have to have it 
fixed in the laboratory.

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:06.190
Laboratory

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:05.510
Ichigo, returning to base.

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:08.630
I see you're hard at work...

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:19.960
<b>Two</b>

00:23:10.350 --> 00:23:11.930
My little brothers.

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:19.960
<b>Three</b>

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:19.960
<b>Four</b>

00:23:18.180 --> 00:23:19.960
<b>Five</b>

00:23:18.180 --> 00:23:19.960
<b>Six</b>

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.760 --> 00:23:22.140
<i>Time for a field trip!</i>

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:23.710
<b>Sata Andagi</b>

00:23:22.140 --> 00:23:23.700
<i>And it's to Okinawa!</i>

00:23:23.700 --> 00:23:25.490
<i>That glittering blue sea!</i>

00:23:25.490 --> 00:23:27.580
<i>Maybe we'll get swimsuits, too!</i>

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:30.380
<i>Next time, "Magical Girl - On Vacation"!</i>

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Magical Girl - On Vacation</b>

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:32.630
<i>Hey, it's a normal next episode preview!</i>

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:34.060
<i>There must be some catch...</i>

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Fish Cakes
Jiranra-ya</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
